  "body": "Using gmail, you can do 'user.name+test1@gmail.com' to create instant aliases of emails\r\nEmails go to the same inbox, but Matrix does not know that.\r\nHowever the + is filtered from the new account form so that it tries to register 'user.name test1@gmail.com' which is not a valid email address.\r\n",
